#. 生物室の矛盾点…
#. それは<CLT 3>生物室のランプ<CLT>の事だよ！
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The inconsistency Kyoko's talking about is...<CLT 3>the\n"
"lights<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. ぎくぅっ！！
msgctxt "0002 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Ga-haaah!"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんなんだよ…
#. あのランプが…なんだって言うのさ…？
msgctxt "0003 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Wh-What are you talking about? What about the\n"
"lights...?"
msgstr ""

#. さっきも言ったけど、あの生物室には、
#. 死体安置所としての役割があったんだ。
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Like I said before, the bio lab also acts as a morgue."
msgstr ""

#. あの部屋に設置されてた<CLT 3>冷蔵庫<CLT>…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And as part of that, a giant <CLT 3>refrigerator<CLT> was\n"
"installed in there."
msgstr ""

#. あの中に、犠牲になったみんなが保存されてるんだ。
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's where everyone who's died is stored."
msgstr ""

#. そして、あの冷蔵庫は、使用中の場合、
#. <CLT 3>ランプが青く点灯する仕組み<CLT>になっていたわ…
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And it was set up so that when a slot had a body in\n"
"it, a <CLT 3>blue light would turn on<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、青いランプが点灯している冷蔵庫には、
#. 死体が入っているという事か。
msgctxt "0008 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"In other words, if the blue light is on, that means\n"
"there's a body in that slot."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、生物室で点灯していたランプの数は、
#. 戦刃むくろの死体が入れられてる冷蔵庫も含めて…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But I counted up the number of blue lights that were\n"
"on, including the one Mukuro was in..."
msgstr ""

#. …全部で<CLT 3>９個<CLT>だけだったんだ。
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...and there were only <CLT 3>nine<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. …それがどうしたんだ？
#. 噛み砕いてジェル状にして言ってくれ！
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Why does that matter? You gotta give me the bite-size\n"
"version here, man!"
msgstr ""

#. １０個
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Ten lights"
msgstr ""

#. ６個
msgctxt "0013 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Six lights"
msgstr ""

#. 実は死体が入っている冷蔵庫が
#. 点灯してるんじゃなくて…
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You see, any slot that has a body in it doesn't light\n"
"up."
msgstr ""

#. 死体が入っていない冷蔵庫だけが
#. 点灯しているんだ…！
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Only the lights on slots without bodies in them come\n"
"on!"
msgstr ""

#. つまり…生き残っているボクたち６人分の冷蔵庫が
#. 点灯していないといけないんだ…！
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In other words, only the slots for us six who are\n"
"still alive should be on...!"
msgstr ""

#. 遺体を入れただけで、
#. 青いランプが点灯し、自動装置が作動する…
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Actually, as soon as you put a body in a slot, the\n"
"blue light comes on, telling you the system is active."
msgstr ""

#. 私が見た取扱説明書には、
#. はっきりと書いてあったけど…？
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That part was made quite clear in the instruction\n"
"manual. Did you read it?"
msgstr ""

#. そういえば…そうだったかも…
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well...yeah, I did."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. ８個
msgctxt "0021 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Eight lights"
msgstr ""

#. ８…！？
#. はッ、そういう事か…！！
msgctxt "0022 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Eight!? But that would mean...!"
msgstr ""

#. ８は西洋では不吉な数って言われてるべ…！！
#. だから９にしたんだべ！
msgctxt "0023 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I've heard that eight is an unlucky number in the\n"
"West. So I say nine's better!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、それなら、
#. そもそも…なんで８個だったのよ…？
msgctxt "0024 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Then...why did he say eight?"
msgstr ""

#. はッ、しまった…！！
msgctxt "0025 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Ah! Damn, good point!"
msgstr ""

#. ９は日本では不吉な数って言われてるべ…！！
#. どっちにしても良くないべ…！
msgctxt "0026 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Because nine is totally an unlucky number Japan! So\n"
"either way we're screwed!"
msgstr ""

#. こりゃうっかりだべ…！！
msgctxt "0027 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Maybe I was thinking of—!"
msgstr ""

#. ハチだけに…うっかり八兵衛…
#. なんて言うんじゃないでしょうね…？
msgctxt "0028 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"An o-octopus? Don't tell *that's* why you th-thought\n"
"of eight..."
msgstr ""

#. お見通しッ！？
msgctxt "0029 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "How'd you know!? I'm just hungry, man!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>空気が淀んでしまったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We're getting really off-track here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. あーあ、うぷぷ…
msgctxt "0032 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Ahh, puhuhu..."
msgstr ""

#. 即答出来る自信がないなら、
#. 発言しないでもらいたいよ！
msgctxt "0033 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"If you're not confident enough to follow up, then\n"
"don't open your mouth in the first place!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この前確認したんだから間違いない…！
#. 死んだ人とランプの数が合わないことに間違いない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I already confirmed it, so there's no doubt that the\n"
"number of bodies and lights don't match!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>９個じゃ…数が合わないんだ…
#. だって、本来なら点灯しているはずのランプの数は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Nine lights doesn't make sense. The number of lights\n"
"that should be on is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
